  "testimonials": {
    "title": "What our 2025 Winners Say",
    "cards": [
      {
        "id": 1,
        "text": "A fantastic initiative that brings the right kind of focus to what the future upholds. By aligning technical partners and skilling innovators, the <strong>Kaushalya Karnataka Awards</strong> are truly setting the stage for the state to become the Skill Capital of India.",
        "logo": "https://bengaluruskillsummit/wp-content/uploads/2026/05/mu-sigma-1.png",
        "company": "Mu Sigma"
      },
      {
        "id": 2,
        "text": "Skills are the need of the hour for every organization. The Bengaluru Skill Summit serves as the vital bridge between institutions like ITIs and GTTCs and the corporate world. Receiving a <strong>Kaushalya Karnataka Awards</strong> validates our commitment to upskilling and proves that when we align education with industry needs, everyone prospers.",
        "logo": "https://bengaluruskillsummit/wp-content/uploads/2026/05/pramana.png",
        "company": "Pramana"
      },
      {
        "id": 3,
        "text": "From AI integration to global skill standards, the Bengaluru Skill Summit covers it all. The <strong>Kaushalya Karnataka Awards</strong> are the perfect culmination of this three-day journey, celebrating the organizations that make Karnataka a powerhouse of entrepreneurship and livelihood.",
        "logo": "https://bengaluruskillsummit/wp-content/uploads/2026/05/hertz-global.png",
        "company": "Hertz Global"
      },
      {
        "id": 4,
        "text": "The Bengaluru Skill Summit is a unique platform where industry and academia finally meet to understand the pulse of skilling in our country. Being honored with the <strong>Kaushalya Karnataka Awards</strong> reinforces my mission at GTTC to ensure our students are trained to meet the highest global standards.",
        "logo": "https://bengaluruskillsummit/wp-content/uploads/2026/05/gttc.png",
        "company": "GTTC"
      },
      {
        "id": 5,
        "text": "On behalf of OPSL Global and SMP’s Electric Control, I want to thank the Government of Karnataka for this amazing initiative. Winning the <strong>Kaushalya Karnataka Awards</strong> is a significant milestone for us, celebrating our shared vision of building a more skilled and competitive workforce.",
        "logo": "https://bengaluruskillsummit/wp-content/uploads/2026/05/smps.png",
        "company": "SMPS"
      },
      {
        "id": 6,
        "text": "Our journey with the skilling ecosystem began years ago, and being recognized today at the Bengaluru Skill Summit is a monumental milestone. The <strong>Kaushalya Karnataka Awards</strong> celebrates the continuous effort of institutions like Lavonne Academy to nurture specialized talent and drive professional excellence across the state.",
        "logo": "https://bengaluruskillsummit/wp-content/uploads/2026/05/lavonne.png",
        "company": "Lavonne Academy"
      },
      {
        "id": 7,
        "text": "We thank the Government of Karnataka and the Department of Skill Development for organizing the Bengaluru Skill Summit. This <strong>Kaushalya Karnataka Awards</strong> serves as a vital recognition for premier institutions like NTTF, proving that when we celebrate excellence in the skilling field, we inspire everyone to do even better for society.",
        "logo": "https://bengaluruskillsummit/wp-content/uploads/2026/05/nttf.png",
        "company": "NTTF"
      },
      {
        "id": 8,
        "text": "Winning the <strong>Kaushalya Karnataka Awards</strong> is a massive milestone for us. The Bengaluru Skill Summit is the perfect platform to celebrate the future-ready skills, like drone aviation, that are putting Karnataka on the global tech map.",
        "logo": "https://bengaluruskillsummit/wp-content/uploads/2026/05/clearskies.png",
        "company": "Clearskies"
      }
    ]
  },
